sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-exc=""><p><b>サイズ詳細</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="1" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1637069237882" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1637069237882"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>長さ: 100cm,&nbsp;<span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">幅: 22cm</span></p></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="2" data-key="content" class="chevron iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1611382311548-1" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1611382311548-1" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-exc=""><p><b>素材</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="2" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1611382369227" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1611382369227"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>表地：ポリエステル100%</p><p>中綿：リサイクルポリエステル70％、植物繊維（カポック）30％</p></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="3" data-key="content" class="chevron iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1644417686112" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1644417686112" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-exc=""><p><b>カーボンフットプリント</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="3" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1644417686133" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1644417686133"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>ダウンストールのカーボンフットプリントは5.79kg-CO2です。</p><p><br></p><p>KAPOK KNOTは素材、製造、消費者の使用によるカーボンフットプリントを算出しています。</p><p></p></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="4" data-key="content" class="chevron iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1611382311548-2" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1611382311548-2" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-exc=""><p><b>お手入れ方法</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="4" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1696506623734" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1696506623734" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/1f79494f-a921-4f15-afeb-63d87375749c/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/%E3%82%BF%E3%82%99%E3%82%A6%E3%83%B3%E3%83%AD%E3%83%BC%E3%83%88%E3%82%99.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="500" natural-height="80" width="500" height="80"></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1611382436656" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1611382436656"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>長時間洗液に浸しておいたり、水や汗に濡れたままの状態で放置しますと、色落ちや色移りの原因になりますのでお避けください。</p><p>着用時の強い摩擦や、水や汗等で湿った状態での摩擦により、他のものに色移りする恐れがあります。</p><p><br></p><p>着脱の際や着用中はアクセサリーや突起物による引っかかりにご注意ください。</p><p>直射日光や蛍光灯の長時間照射で変色することがあります。乾燥・保管の際にはご注意ください。</p><p><br></p><p>素材の特性上、洗濯や着用により、中わたが吹き出したり、細かな繊維が表に飛び出ることがあります。吹き出した中わたは引っ張らずにハサミでカットしてください。また、衣服との組み合わせにより、繊維が目立つ場合があるのでご注意ください。</p><p>中わたが片寄っている部分は軽くほぐし、均等にならしてご着用ください。</p></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="5" data-key="content" class="chevron iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1611382311548-3" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1611382311548-3" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-exc=""><p><b>配送と返品</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="5" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1611382753531" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1611382753531"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>お客様からオーダーを頂いてから、基本的には3日以内にお届けしております。</p><p>（ただし、物流状況に準じますことをご了承ください。）</p><p>また、お客様のお手元に商品が届いてから2週間以内でしたら、返品、交換が可能になります。商品に不良がない限り、商品タグを外して以降の返品、交換は基本的に対応致しかねますので、商品タグは切らずにご試着ください。</p></div></div></article></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1611383050287" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1611383050287" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><a href="https://kapok-knot.com/blogs/news/try_kapok_on" target="" aria-describedby="a11y-external-message"><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/7f912452-6669-4951-87bb-99c2a03b88ba/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/220601_KK_trykapokon_banner.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1145" natural-height="267" width="1145" height="267"></a></div></div><div data-label="Liquid" data-key="liquid" id="m-1611391713901" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-liquid" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1611391713901" data-name="Right click on the module, then choose Edit Html / Liquid option to start writing your custom code." style="background-image: none;"><div class="module gf_module- gf_module--lg gf_module--md gf_module--sm gf_module--xs {{extraClass}}"><div class="klaviyo-form-WVJ2QL"></div></div></div><div data-label="Liquid" data-key="liquid" data-atomgroup="module" id="m-1636944512162" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-liquid" data-ver="1.1" data-id="1636944512162" data-name="Right click on this, and choose Edit Code."><div class="module gf_module- gf_module--lg gf_module--md gf_module--sm gf_module--xs {{extraClass}}"><div id="unisize_1000"></div><script type="text/javascript" src="https://bnr.cl.unisize.makip.co.jp/tag/unisize.js"></script></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1634111942991" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1634111942991"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1634111942916" data-id="1634111942916"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1634111950144" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1634111950144"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><b>空気をまとう軽さで、街でも旅先でもここちよく</b></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1634111995238" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1634111995238"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">旅にこのストールを持っていけば寒い時に活躍。旅先でも心地よく過ごせるように、コンパクトだけど、ダウンの暖かさを。</div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1614053481548" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1614053481548" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614053481513" data-id="1614053481513"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1614054251909" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1614054251909" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054251907" data-id="1614054251907"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1630900616960" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1630900616960" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/4e43986e-af49-4086-98fc-84ffe92e3255/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1287" natural-height="744"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054270702" data-id="1614054270702"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1611383269914" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1611383269914"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><b>軽量なのに、ダウンと同じ暖かさを実現</b></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1611383374996" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1611383374996"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">軽さの秘密はスペシャルな木の実「カポック」。カポックのワタはコットンの1/8 の軽さ、動物の毛皮や羽 毛を使うことも、木を伐採する必要もないスペシャルな素材です。</div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1614054348485" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1614054348485" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054348544" data-id="1614054348544"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1611383505741" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1611383505741"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><b>驚きの暖かさを実現</b></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1611383642114" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1611383642114"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>カポックは特殊な構造によって、湿気を吸い、熱を放出する「吸湿発熱」という機能があります。その機能はダウンに匹敵するため、木に実るダウンとも呼ばれています。</p></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054350458" data-id="1614054350458"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1630900634451" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1630900634451" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/8bb07bb0-797b-4428-bab2-96c95411e95b/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1005" natural-height="594"></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1614055165640" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1614055165640" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12 gf_col-md-12 gf_col-sm-12 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614053481513" data-id="1614053481513"><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1614055165687" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1614055165687" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054251907" data-id="1614054251907"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1630900955966" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1630900955966" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/4e43986e-af49-4086-98fc-84ffe92e3255/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1287" natural-height="744"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054270702" data-id="1614054270702"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1614055165642" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1614055165642"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><b>軽量なのに、ダウンと同じ暖かさを実現</b></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1634111812567" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1634111812567"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">軽さの秘密はスペシャルな木の実「カポック」。カポックのワタはコットンの1/8 の軽さ、動物の毛皮や羽 毛を使うことも、木を伐採する必要もないスペシャルな素材です。さらに、カポックは特殊な構造によって、湿気を吸い、熱を放出する「吸湿発熱」という機能があります。その機能はダウンに匹敵するため、木に実るダウンとも呼ばれています。</div></div></div></div><div data-label="Row" data-key="row" id="r-1630900955995" class="gf_row" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1630900955995" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054251907" data-id="1614054251907"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1614055165734" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1614055165734" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/8bb07bb0-797b-4428-bab2-96c95411e95b/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" data-width="auto" data-height="auto" title="" natural-width="1005" natural-height="594"></div></div></div><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-6 gf_col-md-6 gf_col-sm-6 gf_col-xs-12" id="c-1614054270702" data-id="1614054270702"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1630900956002" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1630900956002"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left-lg" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><b>着膨れしないダウン</b></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1630900955938" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1630900955938"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc="">着膨れするダウンのイメージを覆すような驚くほど軽くてカジュアルシックな上品ダウンを実現。軽くて着てないかのような軽さで羽織れ、それでいてダウンの暖かさがある。</div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" class="gf_row" id="r-1611384474582" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1611384474582"><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12" id="c-1611384474538" data-id="1611384474538"><div data-label="Heading" data-key="heading" id="e-1611384491683" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-ver="1" data-id="1611384491683"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><strong>「farm to fashion」一緒に旅してみませんか？</strong></h2></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div data-label="Row" class="gf_row" id="r-1611385005456" data-icon="gpicon-row" data-id="1611385005456" data-extraclass=""><div class="gf_column gf_col-lg-12" id="c-1611385005578" data-id="1611385005578"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1611385010857" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1611385010857"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" 